        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jeremy Renner, Daniel S. Levine, Shawn Levy, Eric Marlon Bishop, David Linde\n- Films: The Town, Arrival\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Picture, Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor\n\nFacts:\n- In 2010, Jeremy Renner was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for the film The Town.\n- In 2016, Jeremy Renner acted in the film Arrival.\n- In 2016, Daniel S. Levine was a producer of Arrival.\n- Arrival earned an Academy Award for Best Picture nomination for its producers Shawn Levy, Dan Levine, Aaron Ryder, and David Linde.\n- Eric Marlon Bishop is the birth name of Jamie Foxx, not a producer credited with Arrival's Best Picture nomination.",
